 replay set is every non-undone schedule-feeding review addressed to Wc, Mc or L1c: r3, r4, in (reviewed_at, hlc, id) order. r1 and r2 are undone.\"],\"order_free\":true,\"title\":\"A card merged twice (L1 -> M -> W) with undos addressed to both losers\"}",
