.\",\"B's review keeps card_id = L's card; it is in the replay set of W's meaning card together with A's own review.\",\"B itself reaches the same state when it pulls the server-emitted ops: note.merged forwards L's clocked registers (sentence@20, tags@30), card.merged forwards suspended@31.\"],\"order_free\":true,\"title\":\"The same word is added on two devices offline\"}",
